&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Cloud Performance Engineer to work with technology teams across&amp;nbsp;the firm to build high-performance cloud solutions for trading workloads. You will join the&amp;nbsp;Cloud Performance Team, working alongside cloud engineers, software developers,&amp;nbsp;Linux- and network engineers to optimize performance end to end.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate draws on experience in cloud technology, systems engineering, networking and automation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do in this role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Design and implement cloud and hybrid cloud architectures for latency-sensitive&amp;nbsp;trading workloads.&lt;br&gt;• Build and maintain systems that continuously monitor the latency characteristics of&amp;nbsp;distributed hybrid workloads.&lt;br&gt;• Work on orchestration tooling for provisioning cloud resources as well as networking&amp;nbsp;configurations and server-side processes&lt;br&gt;• Build backend systems for collecting performance metrics and tooling to query it&lt;/p&gt;
