&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Experience building data pipelines for centralizing structured data&lt;br&gt;• Experience working with Cisco routing and switching hardware&lt;br&gt;• Experience working with Google Cloud Platform&lt;br&gt;• Experience programming in a compiled languages (preferably Go or C++)&lt;br&gt;• Experience with Linux kernel bypass techniques such as DPDK.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
