&lt;li&gt;Have a background in multi-threaded programming and a strong understanding of hardware/software interaction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable working “under the hood” and you are quite skilled in performance tuning (applications, Linux, socket I/O, etc.) and troubleshooting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience working with C++ libraries like STL and Boost&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are up to date on the C++23 standards and have opinions about them&lt;/li&gt;
