&lt;p&gt;Qube Research &amp;amp; Technologies (QRT) is a global quantitative and systematic investment manager, operating in all liquid asset classes across the world. We are a technology and data driven group implementing a scientific approach to investing. Combining data, research, technology and trading expertise has shaped QRT’s collaborative mindset which enables us to solve the most complex challenges. QRT’s culture of innovation continuously drives our ambition to deliver high quality returns for our investors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your future role within QRT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the architecture and technical direction of crypto market connectivity, supporting QRT’s trading activities across digital asset exchanges and liquidity providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design, development, validation, deployment and production support of low-latency trading gateways and market data handlers for crypto venues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee market data ingestion, sequencing, normalisation, order book construction and downstream distribution across fragmented venues with differing protocols and data standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own exchange integrations, connectivity upgrades and venue onboardings, including gap analysis, implementation and testing, working directly with exchanges and third-party providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop frameworks for data quality monitoring, gap detection, reconciliation, recovery and replay, addressing inconsistent schemas and varying levels of data quality across venues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive improvements in latency, throughput, resilience and operational stability within a 24/7 trading environment, defining technical KPIs and operational metrics to measure progress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with traders, quantitative researchers and developers to deliver reliable market data and execution connectivity that support crypto trading strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale connectivity systems to support new exchanges, digital assets, spot and derivatives products, and evolving market structures.&lt;/li&gt;
