&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in exchange trading gateways, market data feed handlers or connectivity platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of crypto exchange architecture and connectivity across major venues such as Binance, OKX, Bybit etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with exchange APIs and protocols, including WebSocket, REST, FIX and binary protocols where available.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and implementing real-time distributed systems, with strong knowledge of networking, multithreading, concurrency and memory optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of market data sequencing, normalisation, order book construction and replay mechanisms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing recovery and reconciliation processes to manage unreliable data sources, connectivity interruptions and exchange-specific behaviours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good knowledge of crypto market structure, liquidity fragmentation, spot markets and derivatives, including perpetual futures.&lt;/li&gt;
