&lt;li&gt;A track record of delivering production systems with measurable improvements in performance, reliability or trading capability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and problem-solving skills, with the ability to collaborate effectively across engineering, trading, quantitative research and operational teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with decentralised exchange connectivity or traditional market access systems would be advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
