&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced Trading Systems Software Engineer to help build the applications, platforms and engineering capabilities that support QRT’s global trading environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;This is a broad software engineering role spanning application development, distributed systems, cloud technology, deployment automation and production engineering. You will design and build software used by traders, quantitative researchers, operations teams and other engineers across the firm.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future Role within QRT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Design, develop and maintain production-grade applications, services and APIs supporting QRT’s trading platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Build shared platforms and reusable capabilities that can be adopted across multiple trading desks and engineering teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Develop modern web applications and operational tools that improve visibility, control and efficiency across trading workflows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Design scalable distributed and event-driven systems that integrate with trading platforms, market data services and internal infrastructure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Build deployment tooling, release automation and self-service capabilities that make software easier and safer to deploy and operate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Develop automated workflows for data processing, operational tasks and engineering processes using technologies such as Apache Airflow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Partner with traders, quantitative researchers and operations teams to understand their needs and solve practical business problems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Design software for latency-sensitive environments, balancing performance with reliability, scalability and operational simplicity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Build observable and resilient systems with appropriate monitoring, alerting, recovery and failure-handling capabilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Work alongside infrastructure, cloud and DevOps engineers to deploy and support software across global production environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Contribute to technical design and architectural decisions, evaluating new technologies where they can deliver meaningful value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Take ownership of software throughout its lifecycle, from initial design and implementation through to production support and continuous improvement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Your present skillset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;At least five years of experience developing and supporting production-grade software.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Strong programming and software engineering skills in one or more languages such as Python, Java, Go, Node.js or C++.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Experience designing maintainable, testable and scalable applications and services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;A strong understanding of software design principles, data structures, algorithms and engineering fundamentals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Experience building RESTful APIs, distributed systems or event-driven architectures.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Exposure to containerisation, orchestration and delivery technologies such as Docker, Kubernetes and CI/CD pipelines.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Experience with public cloud technologies, preferably AWS.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;An understanding of messaging technologies such as Kafka or RabbitMQ.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Experience considering reliability, observability, performance and failure recovery when designing production systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, with the ability to make sound engineering decisions and explain the associated trade-offs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;The ability to work effectively with both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
