&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you don’t meet every requirement listed, we still encourage you to apply. We value potential and are excited to see what you can bring to the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be doing with us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full lifecycle of software development for market making, working alongside traders and developers in other teams, such as FPGA, data analytics and UI developers&lt;/li&gt;
