&lt;li&gt;Experience with portfolio construction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Docker, Kubernetes, ArgoCD (or equivalent systems).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and maintaining production systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of other programming languages (C++, C#, JavaScript/TypeScript).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AI tools for analysis, programming, or research.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
